--- Environmental constraint (same as NEARS-2343's own QA finding) ---
Neither call site's Future resolves to LoginStatus.failed in this browser-
fallback path without completing a REAL Facebook login (no Facebook app
installed on the emulator, no real FB test credentials available to this
QA pass) — backing out of the custom tab resolves as LoginStatus.cancelled,
which is correctly silent per the ticket's own code comment (NEARS-2343:
"a user backing out (cancelled) isn't an error"). No [FAIL]/[ERR] AppLogger
line fired for the cancel path (correct — cancel is not an error branch).
No AndroidRuntime:E crash at any point; app returned cleanly to the
Sign-In screen both times.

